[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=8 format=3]

; M_PanelTrim (PBR) — bolts, brackets, reveal steps, cross ribs, bands.
;
; The armour set: heavier forms, welded seams, and a LOWER base roughness than
; the wall panels. Two materials that differ only in albedo read as one
; material. Two that differ in roughness read as two, because they disagree
; about where the highlight is — which is the only cue that survives in a room
; lit by one moving flashlight.

